    {
      "description": "The **Verification Report API** allows partners to retrieve the verified categories (for example, \u0060IDENTITY\u0060, \u0060WORKPLACE\u0060) associated with a LinkedIn Member, or to obtain a \u0060verificationUrl\u0060 that enables Members to complete eligible verifications on LinkedIn. VerificationCriteria does not filter out verifications, it is only for the verificationUrl generated to show which categories the partner is interested in.",
      "id": "e2a85f26-c47e-45ee-acd8-822acfb99953",
