    {
      "description": "The **Validation Status API** lets Plus-tier partners check the current validation state of LinkedIn members at scale (single or bulk). It returns compact status flags for \u0060identity\u0060, \u0060workplace\u0060, and \u0060profileInformationStatus\u0060 so you can quickly identify which members need fresh profile or verification data. This endpoint uses **2-legged OAuth (client credentials)** \u2014 no member consent required \u2014 and supports up to **500 member IDs per request** (use the \u0060id\u0060 from \u0060/identityMe\u0060 or \u0060/verificationReport\u0060).",
      "id": "aa57a0f4-00f0-49b7-8b3c-24da5e554e24",
